home-dashboard-plan.md
# `.claude/skills/` is knowledge, not tool state, and carries no credentials — so it
# is tracked. Everything else under .claude/ is local settings/cache. Note the `/*`
# form: git cannot re-include a path whose parent directory is excluded, so a bare
# `.claude/` would defeat the negation below.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/

# Misc
test.md
docs/conversation.jsonl
.migration-backup/

__pycache__/
